        "description": {
            "value": "<p>        <p class=\"cc-desc\">You believe Uriel's Turning was a mercy the world flinched away from before it finished, and that a second, cleaner burning is still owed. You gain Cinders by committing violence in Uriel's name, recovering relics of the Turning, and feeding the belief — yours and others' — that the world must break again to be made right.</p>\n        <hr class=\"cc-divider\">\n        <div class=\"cc-effect\"><b>PRESENCE —</b> enemies near you find their resolve harder to hold onto. Nothing dramatic. Just a little closer to breaking than they'd be otherwise.</div></p>"
        },
